A good Stream pipeline usually looks like:
Source
   ↓
filter()
   ↓
map()
   ↓
sorted() (if needed)
   ↓
collect()/toList()/findFirst()/count()
This is the pattern you'll use in most interview questions.



Remember Forever
Use comparingInt() when comparing primitive int values.

Examples:
Comparator.comparingInt(Employee::getSalary)
Comparator.comparingInt(String::length)
Comparator.comparingInt(Product::getPrice)

